.DS_Store
__pycache__/

# Trained random forest models. These are build artifacts, not source: the
# pipeline regenerates them from r-pipeline/aq_MetDaily_*.csv on every run, and
# because training is stochastic each run produces a byte-different file.
#
# They used to be committed twice a day. At 1-9 MB each x 6 sites that grew the
# repository to 1.75 GB of pack in two months, against a working tree of ~35 MB.
# History was rewritten on 2026-08-04 to remove them.
#
# Nothing that a clone needs is lost: the dashboard reads the committed JSON in
# data/ (including importance.json), and anyone running the R pipeline trains
# the models as step one anyway.
r-pipeline/*.rds
